Pinned Morpher_CGRA_Mapper source change for commit
9a9dce7aea521f1d5ef33686f57ca84864edb3c9.

The vendored checkout has no usable upstream submodule metadata, so this
artifact is paired with the exact post-patch source digests in
PATCH_MANIFEST.md. Changes are applied to these files:

* include/morpher/util/util.h: add non-negative integer --seed (default 0),
  recording random_seed and has_random_seed.
* src/CGRA_xml_compiler.cpp: pass the explicit seed to SAMapper for -m 1.
